    - title: Name
      value: Proving Grounds
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Pictures
      value: '[]'
      type: 3
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
    - title: Description
      value: "Old Mal has saved your life and given you a second chance to face the
        dangers of the dungeon. Armed with a blade that once belonged to his son,
        you are tasked with proving you\u2019re not just another casualty. Your trial
        is simple: return with a 5x goblin skull as proof of your survival and capability."
      type: 0
      typeString: 
